                    120.0,
                    796.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 1.07 All matters coming before the Labor-Management Committee shall be decided by a majority vote. Four members of the Committee, two from each of the parties hereto, shall be a quorum for the transaction of business, but each party shall have the right to cast the full vote of its membership and it shall be counted as though all were present and voting.",
            "block_bbox": [
                119,
